Bundled third-party content
---------------------------
Create (MIT) -- one overridden texture under assets/create/.

TerraFirmaCraft (EUPL-1.2) -- no TFC code and no TFC textures are redistributed.
Present are woodencog-authored data pack overrides under data/tfc/, plus
assets/tfc/blockstates/charcoal_forge.json. The latter is a compatibility
override: a mod cannot append a variant to another mod's block state file, so the
nine-entry variant table replaces TFC's eight-entry table. Its eight original
entries are unmodified model references and its textures are untouched; the ninth
entry points at this mod's own model.

Wildfires -- the tier 8 top-face texture at
assets/woodencog/textures/block/devices/charcoal_forge/8.png and its .mcmeta are
copies of Wildfires' earthen_oven_heat_8.png. That sprite is original artwork
authored for Wildfires (16x32 with two frames, whereas TFC's tier 7 texture is
16x208 with thirteen) and is reused here by its own author as their own work.

Wildfires -- compat/create/FanOverheatGuard.java and mixin/MixinFanOverheat.java are
the relocated Wildfires fan guard (first.wildfires.compat.create.FanOverheatGuard
and first.wildfires.mixin.create.FanOverheatMixin). They were changed only where
they read the two ceilings, which now come from this mod's config, and the mixin
keeps the same priority. Reused here by their own author as their own work.
